      "date": "2026-05-12T11:46:10.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS exceeds analyst expectations while revenues lag behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.57 (up from ₹6.29 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹497.8b (up 16% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹14.1b (up 36% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.8% (up from 2.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 2.5%. Earnings per share (EPS) exceeded analyst estimates by 22%. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.7% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 11% growth forecast for the Insurance industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 10% per year.",
